    "title": "A Speed Demon With Flame Maple Looks That Kill - Now Available in Stoptail",
    "body": "Part of the Modern Collection, the Kramer Striker™ Figured HSS is a gorgeous entry into the high-performance, shred-ready world of Kramer guitars! Along with its stunning AAA flame maple top veneer, it features a satin-finished maple neck with a Kramer K-Speed SlimTaper™ C profile that's fast, easy to play, and incredibly comfortable. Exceptional sonic versatility comes courtesy of a zebra-coil bridge humbucker™ and two single coils, delivering sparkling cleans as easily as harder-rocking tones that can cover a variety of styles. An Epiphone™ LockTone Tune-O-Matic™ bridge and Stop Bar tailpiece ensure excellent intonation and loads of sustain. An optional hardshell case is available."
